  "bodyHash": "9v/7NTG9THo=",
  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/light/label.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"171\"></p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/progress.png\" width=\"621\" height=\"35\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><div style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"display:inline-block\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/recolourful-containers-gui-hud-dark\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"display:block;width:375px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/buttons/dark_button_mini.png\"> </a> <a style=\"display:inline-block\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft-bedrock/texture-packs/recolourful-containers-be\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"display:block;width:375px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/buttons/bedrock_button_mini.png\"> </a> <a style=\"display:inline-block\" href=\"https://discord.gg/zTYjykBHkJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"display:block;width:60px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/buttons/discord_button_mini.png\"> </a></div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/light/showcase.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2274\" height=\"749\"></p><hr><blockquote style=\"padding-left:20px;font-style:italic;color:#666\">\n<p>「厭倦了 Minecraft 的基本使用者介面？每次靠近附魔台都看到和合成台一樣的灰色選單？想為你的遊戲增添一些色彩嗎？</p>\n<p>隆重介紹 Colourful Containers！這是一個容器 GUI 取代模組，旨在讓每個選單都能對應 Minecraft 中色彩繽紛的互動方塊。」</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:right\"><strong>- Chris XENO</strong></p>\n</blockquote><h2 style=\"line-height:normal\">而現在，我推出了完全<strong>重</strong>製、<strong>重</strong>新紋理、<strong>重</strong>新想像的版本——<strong><span style=\"color:#d32927\">R</span><span style=\"color:#e66826\">e</span><span style=\"color:#ec9222\">c</span><span style=\"color:#eab718\">o</span><span style=\"color:#cbd541\">l</span><span style=\"color:#86e441\">o</span><span style=\"color:#7bd6c8\">u</span><span style=\"color:#419be5\">r</span><span style=\"color:#3777e0\">f</span><span style=\"color:#8665e0\">u</span><span style=\"color:#c76ee4\">l </span>Containers</strong>，支援新版本、全新紋理，以及更深入的沉浸感！</h2><p style=\"line-height:normal\">所有 GUI 都已根據其關聯的方塊進行重新設計。包含原版 Minecraft 紋理修正、HUD 變更，甚至是原版動畫 GUI，還有更多更多<strong>豐富內容！</strong></p><p style=\"line-height:normal\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/labels/changes.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2001\" height=\"99\"></p><p><strong>變更的紋理圖示：</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/light/graphic.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2988\" height=\"5328\"></p>\n</div><p><strong>變更的紋理清單：</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li>合成台</li>\n<li>鐵砧&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>附魔台&nbsp;&nbsp;<img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>釀造台</li>\n<li>織布機</li>\n<li>製圖台&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>切石機&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>砂輪</li>\n<li>鍛造台&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>合成器&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>投擲器、發射器&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>熔爐、高爐、煙燻爐&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"> <em>(1.20.2+)</em></li>\n<li>漏斗</li>\n<li>儲物箱</li>\n<li>儲物箱船 <em>(1.21.2+)</em></li>\n<li>儲物箱礦車</li>\n<li>鸚鵡螺與殭屍鸚鵡螺</li>\n<li>村民</li>\n<li>背包</li>\n<li>配方書</li>\n<li>書</li>\n<li>烽火台</li>\n<li>HUD</li>\n<li>經驗值條&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"> <em>(1.20.2+)</em></li>\n<li>一些小型 UI 變更與修正</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong><span style=\"color:#009c9c\">「Vanilla+」</span>功能 </strong>（請閱讀「安裝指南」以了解更多資訊）<strong>：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>村民的職業 GUI&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"></li>\n<li>終界箱&nbsp; <img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"65\" height=\"24\"></li>\n<li>木桶</li>\n<li>馬、骷髏馬、殭屍馬</li>\n<li>駱馬、騾子、驢子、羊駝</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h3><strong>OptiFine/OptiGUI 功能：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>村民的 GUI，包含所有種類與職業的組合 <em>（OptiGUI 獨佔）&nbsp; </em><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"62\" height=\"23\"> <em>（Animatica 獨佔）</em></li>\n<li>終界箱</li>\n<li>陷阱儲物箱</li>\n<li>聖誕儲物箱</li>\n<li>銅儲物箱及其變種 <em>（OptiGUI 獨佔）</em></li>\n<li>木桶 <em>（OptiGUI 獨佔）</em></li>\n<li>各色界伏盒</li>\n<li>馬、骷髏馬、殭屍馬</li>\n<li>駱馬、騾子、驢子（有無儲物箱 - <em>OptiGUI 獨佔</em>）</li>\n<li>羊駝（含地毯顏色）</li>\n<li>受損的鐵砧 <em>（OptiGUI 獨佔）</em></li>\n<li>寫過的書 <em>（OptiGUI+Animatica 獨佔）&nbsp; </em><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Re-colourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/animated.png\" width=\"65\" height=\"24\"></li>\n<li> lectern 上的書 <em>（OptiGUI 獨佔）</em></li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>模組支援：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Accessories</li>\n<li>Armor Chroma</li>\n<li>Axiom</li>\n<li>Backslot <em>（OptiGUI 獨佔）</em></li>\n<li>Charm of Undying <em>（OptiGUI 獨佔）</em></li>\n<li>Better Enchanting</li>\n<li>Cloth Config</li>\n<li>Detail Armor Bar</li>\n<li>ItemSwapper</li>\n<li>Language Reload</li>\n<li>Mod Menu</li>\n<li>Recursive Resources</li>\n<li>Sawmill</li>\n<li>What Are They Up To</li>\n<li>Horseman</li>\n</ul>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><h4 style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/labels/installation.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2001\" height=\"99\"></h4><h3 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h3><h3 style=\"text-align:center\">若想獲得完整體驗，需要安裝 OptiGUI 或 OptiFine！</h3><div style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"display:inline-block\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252foptigui%252fversions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"display:block;width:303px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/buttons/optigui.png\" height=\"60\"> </a>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<a style=\"display:inline-block\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252foptifine.net%252fdownloads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img style=\"display:block;width:303px\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/buttons/optifine.png\" height=\"60\"> </a>&nbsp;</div><div style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</div><h3>如果您不想使用 OptiGUI，或者只使用 OptiFine 模組，可以在語言設定中啟用內建的 <span style=\"color:#009c9c\">「Vanilla+」</span>模式</h3><p>如何啟用：</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/vanilla_version.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1390\" height=\"340\"></p>\n<p>如需支援其他語言，請使用主檔案下方 <span style=\"color:#f16131\">「Additional files」</span>分頁中的獨立 VANILLA+ 包</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/curseforge_additional_files.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"390\" height=\"150\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/labels/q&amp;a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2001\" height=\"103\"></p><p><strong>問與答：</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h4><strong>問：如果我有其他問題（此清單未列出），可以在哪裡詢問？</strong></h4>\n<p><strong>答：</strong> 留下評論，或加入 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/zTYjykBHkJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Recolourful Discord 伺服器</a>，在那裡詢問！</p>\n<p><strong>已知問題清單：</strong></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<h4><strong>使用 OptiFine 時：</strong></h4>\n<ul>\n<li>村民職業無法運作</li>\n<li>木桶顯示儲物箱 GUI 紋理</li>\n<li>儲物箱船顯示最近訪問的儲物箱類容器 GUI 紋理</li>\n<li>部分類似馬的實體不受支援</li>\n</ul>\n<p>如果只使用 OptiFine，建議使用 <span style=\"color:#009c9c\">「Vanilla+」</span>模式</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>使用 <span style=\"color:#009c9c\">「Vanilla+」</span>模式時：</strong></h4>\n<ul>\n<li>在 1.21.9+ 版本中，重新命名後的界伏盒不會顯示有色 GUI</li>\n<li>界伏盒的欄位高亮效果在某些版本中看起來怪異或無法顯示</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\n<h4><strong>問：儲物箱/界伏盒/村民職業 GUI 無法運作！</strong></h4>\n<p><strong>答：</strong> 請確認您是否已安裝 OptiGUI 或 OptiFine，或已將語言切換為 <span style=\"color:#009c9c\">「Vanilla+」</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>問：你能支援 X 模組嗎？</strong></h4>\n<p><strong>答：</strong> 簡單來說：理論上可以。請在評論中留下建議，或在 Discord 中提交！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>問：我可以在模組包中使用 Recolourful Containers 嗎？/我可以修改 Recolourful Containers 嗎？/我可以對 Recolourful Containers 進行 X 操作嗎？</strong></h4>\n<p><strong>答：</strong> 請查看描述底部的使用條款</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>問：我想支援你！該怎麼做？</strong></h4>\n<p><strong>答：</strong> 關於這個……</p>\n</div><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/labels/support.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2001\" height=\"99\"></p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbilling.sparkedhost.com%252faff.php%253faff%253d3086\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/image.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1501\" height=\"160\"></a></p><h3>如果您不需要伺服器但仍想支援我，<strong>請將此資源包與朋友分享，或在 YouTube、TikTok、Instagram 等任何平台上展示！ </strong>只需留下此頁面的連結，我將非常感謝！</h3><hr><h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>別忘了按讚並追蹤以獲取未來更新！</strong></h2><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/curseforge.png\" width=\"121\" height=\"54\"></p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/zTYjykBHkJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/buttons/discord_button.png\" width=\"396\" height=\"60\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/labels/credits.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2001\" height=\"99\"></p><ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252fchris_xeno%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Chris_XENO</a></strong> 感謝他原創的 Colourful Containers 紋理包</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/shrimpsnail\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Shrimpsnail</a></strong> 感謝他協助自訂著色器程式碼，許多功能都因他而得以實現</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/kryqu/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Kryqu</a></strong> 感謝他提供村民 GUI 的靈感</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Vi-Tul/Recolourful-Containers-description/refs/heads/main/labels/terms.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2001\" height=\"99\"></p><p><strong>使用條款：</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>如果您覺得無法對這個資源包進行某項操作，請事先詢問我 :)</strong></p>\n<h3><strong>您可以：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>將此資源包包含在免費的模組包中</li>\n<li>將此資源包用於您的私人伺服器</li>\n<li>修改此資源包（僅限個人使用）</li>\n<li>在任何形式的媒體中使用此資源包，包括 YouTube、Twitch 等</li>\n</ul>\n<h3><strong>您不可以：</strong></h3>\n<ul>\n<li>未經本人同意，在任何平台上以任何形式散佈此資源包、其資產及修改後的資產</li>\n</ul>\n</div><hr><p>&nbsp;</p>",
